#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate/scripts.inc:296
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate_Text_FirstTimeHereThisWay"
msgid ""
"Is it your first time here?\n"
"Please step this way!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate/scripts.inc:300
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate_Text_WelcomeToBattleFrontier"
msgid ""
"The front lines of POKéMON battling!\n"
"Welcome to the BATTLE FRONTIER!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate/scripts.inc:304
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate_Text_IssueFrontierPass"
msgid ""
"For a first-time visitor, we issue\n"
"the FRONTIER PASS.\p"
"It's for use at all the facilities\n"
"in the BATTLE FRONTIER.\p"
"Here you are!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate/scripts.inc:311
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate_Text_ObtainedFrontierPass"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} obtained\n"
"the FRONTIER PASS.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate/scripts.inc:315
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate_Text_PlacedTrainerCardInFrontierPass"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} placed the TRAINER CARD\n"
"in the FRONTIER PASS.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate/scripts.inc:319
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate_Text_EnjoyBattleFrontier"
msgid ""
"We hope you enjoy all that the BATTLE\n"
"FRONTIER has to offer!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate/scripts.inc:323
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate_Text_IfItIsntPlayerYouCame"
msgid ""
"???: Well, if it isn't {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"You came out here!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate/scripts.inc:327
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate_Text_OhMrScottGoodDay"
msgid ""
"GUIDE: Oh! MR. SCOTT, sir!\n"
"Good day to you, sir!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate/scripts.inc:331
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate_Text_ScottGreatToSeeYouHere"
msgid ""
"SCOTT: It's great to see you here,\n"
"it really is!\p"
"I hope you'll take your time and\n"
"explore everywhere.\p"
"Naturally, I hope you'll also experience\n"
"the pure essence of battling.\p"
"I also have my quarters here, so feel\n"
"free to visit if you have time.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate/scripts.inc:341
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate_Text_YourGuideToFacilities"
msgid ""
"I'm your guide to the various facilities\n"
"here in the BATTLE FRONTIER.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate/scripts.inc:345
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate_Text_LearnAboutWhich2"
msgid "Which would you like to learn about?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate/scripts.inc:348
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate_Text_BattleTowerInfo"
msgid ""
"It is the gigantic tower considered\n"
"to be the BATTLE FRONTIER's symbol.\p"
"There are four kinds of BATTLE ROOMS\n"
"in the tower for SINGLE, DOUBLE, MULTI,\l"
"and LINK MULTI BATTLES.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate/scripts.inc:355
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate_Text_BattleDomeInfo"
msgid ""
"The BATTLE DOME is the large building\n"
"shaped like a huge egg.\p"
"Events named Battle Tourneys are held\n"
"in this facility.\p"
"The Battle Tourneys are offered in\n"
"two courses--for SINGLE and DOUBLE\l"
"BATTLES.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate/scripts.inc:364
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate_Text_BattlePalaceInfo"
msgid ""
"The BATTLE PALACE is the red building\n"
"on the right of the BATTLE FRONTIER.\p"
"There are two kinds of BATTLE HALLS\n"
"for SINGLE and DOUBLE BATTLES.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate/scripts.inc:370
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate_Text_BattleArenaInfo"
msgid ""
"The BATTLE ARENA is the dojo-like\n"
"building at the center-right of\l"
"the BATTLE FRONTIER.\p"
"An event called the Set KO Tourney\n"
"takes place at the BATTLE ARENA.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate/scripts.inc:377
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate_Text_BattleFactoryInfo"
msgid ""
"The BATTLE FACTORY is the large\n"
"building that is the closest to us.\p"
"An event called the Battle Swap\n"
"is conducted there.\p"
"The Battle Swap event is offered in\n"
"two courses for SINGLE and DOUBLE\l"
"BATTLES.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate/scripts.inc:386
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate_Text_BattlePikeInfo"
msgid ""
"The BATTLE PIKE is the building shaped\n"
"like a POKéMON at the center-left of\l"
"the BATTLE FRONTIER.\p"
"An event called the Battle Choice\n"
"is conducted there.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate/scripts.inc:393
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate_Text_BattlePyramidInfo"
msgid ""
"The BATTLE PYRAMID is the enormous\n"
"pyramid.\p"
"An event called the Battle Quest\n"
"is conducted there.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate/scripts.inc:399
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate_Text_RankingHallInfo"
msgid ""
"The RANKING HALL is located near\n"
"the BATTLE TOWER.\p"
"There, you may see the most fantastic\n"
"records left by the TRAINERS that\l"
"took on the many challenges of\l"
"the BATTLE FRONTIER.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate/scripts.inc:407
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate_Text_ExchangeCornerInfo"
msgid ""
"The EXCHANGE SERVICE CORNER is near\n"
"the BATTLE TOWER.\p"
"The Battle Points you have earned in\n"
"the BATTLE FRONTIER may be exchanged\l"
"for fabulous prizes there.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate/scripts.inc:414
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate_Text_YourGuideToRules"
msgid ""
"I'm your guide to the basic rules that\n"
"are common to all the challenges\l"
"offered by the facilities in the BATTLE\l"
"FRONTIER.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate/scripts.inc:420
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate_Text_LearnAboutWhat"
msgid "What would you like to learn about?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate/scripts.inc:423
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate_Text_LevelModeInfo"
msgid ""
"All the challenges at the BATTLE\n"
"FRONTIER's facilities come in\l"
"two courses--Level 50 and Open Level.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate/scripts.inc:428
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate_Text_Level50Info"
msgid ""
"The Level 50 course is open to POKéMON\n"
"up to and including Level 50.\p"
"Please keep in mind, however, that\n"
"no TRAINER you face will have any\l"
"POKéMON below Level 50.\p"
"This course is the entry level for\n"
"battles at the BATTLE FRONTIER.\p"
"To begin, we hope you will challenge\n"
"this course.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate/scripts.inc:439
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate_Text_OpenLevelInfo"
msgid ""
"The Open Level course places no limit\n"
"on the levels of POKéMON entering\l"
"challenges.\p"
"The levels of your opponents will\n"
"be adjusted to match the levels of\l"
"your POKéMON.\p"
"However, no TRAINER you face will\n"
"have any POKéMON below Level 60.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate/scripts.inc:449
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate_Text_MonEntryInfo"
msgid ""
"Virtually any kind of POKéMON may take\n"
"on the challenges at all facilities.\p"
"EGGS and certain kinds of POKéMON,\n"
"however, are not permitted.\p"
"The numbers of POKéMON required for\n"
"challenges will depend on the facility.\p"
"At all facilities, however, two or more\n"
"of the same kind of POKéMON are not\l"
"permitted.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate/scripts.inc:460
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate_Text_HoldItemsInfo"
msgid ""
"When entering a challenge at a BATTLE\n"
"FRONTIER facility, POKéMON may not\l"
"be holding the same kind of item.\p"
"Please make sure that all POKéMON\n"
"entering a challenge are holding\l"
"different items.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate/scripts.inc:468
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate_Text_YourGuideToFrontierPass"
msgid "I'm your guide to the FRONTIER PASS.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate/scripts.inc:471
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate_Text_LearnAboutWhich1"
msgid "Which would you like to learn about?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate/scripts.inc:474
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate_Text_SymbolsInfo"
msgid ""
"There are seven facilities at\n"
"the BATTLE FRONTIER.\p"
"TRAINERS who gain recognition for\n"
"their abilities may be rewarded with\l"
"symbols from each of the facilities.\p"
"To earn a symbol, TRAINERS may need\n"
"to defeat other TRAINERS in a row,\l"
"and may need to win events repeatedly.\p"
"It's certainly not easy to win symbols.\n"
"I wish you the best of luck!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate/scripts.inc:486
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate_Text_RecordedBattleInfo"
msgid ""
"It is possible to record one battle\n"
"on your FRONTIER PASS.\p"
"You may record a battle you had with\n"
"a friend or friends.\p"
"Or you may record a battle conducted\n"
"at the BATTLE FRONTIER excluding\l"
"matches at the BATTLE PIKE or\l"
"the BATTLE PYRAMID.\p"
"You may choose to record your match\n"
"at the end of a battle.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate/scripts.inc:498
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_ReceptionGate_Text_BattlePointsInfo"
msgid ""
"Battle Points are rewards given to\n"
"TRAINERS who battled outstandingly\l"
"at the BATTLE FRONTIER.\p"
"You may trade in your Battle Points\n"
"for prizes at the EXCHANGE SERVICE\l"
"CORNER.$"
msgstr ""
